<title>PAKISTAN: Lever Pakistan net profit 523 mln rupees.</title>
<headline>Lever Pakistan net profit 523 mln rupees.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eighteen months to June 30, 1996 vs calendar 1994 (in million rupees):</p>
<p>    Sales		     17,297 vs 10,132</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     848 vs   365</p>
<p>    After-tax profit	   523 vs   225</p>
<p>    1st interim div paid  20 pct vs   nil pct per 50-rupee share</p>
<p>    2nd interim div paid  20 pct vs   nil</p>
<p>    Final dividend	  60 pct vs    20 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Lever Brothers Pakistan Ltd. The results are for 18 months to June 30. Firm has changed financial year to July-June from January-December. Book closure Sept 30 to Oct</p>
